This source package is a compatibility-only repackaging of GNU binutils
2.41.  It builds just the private runtime libraries:

  libopcodes-2.41-system.so
  libbfd-2.41-system.so
  libsframe.so.1

They are needed by prebuilt binaries that were linked against the
binutils 2.41 private libraries, notably the objtool binary shipped in
some Deepin kernel headers packages.

The libraries keep the versioned "-system" SONAMEs introduced by
debian/patches/135_bfd_soversion.patch, so they can coexist with the
private libraries of the binutils version currently installed in the
system (for example 2.47's libopcodes-2.47-system.so and
libsframe.so.3).

Build with:

  dpkg-buildpackage -b -uc -us

The 3.0 (quilt) source format applies debian/patches/series before the
build.  Only bfd, opcodes and libsframe are built; as, ld, objdump and
the other binutils programs are deliberately not built or installed.
